00:42:45.291 --> 00:42:48.480
And so when I'm only allowed to pick the top two,

00:42:48.481 --> 00:42:50.680
and I swap in this person for that person,

00:42:50.681 --> 00:42:52.440
it might be a win, because this person may have

00:42:52.441 --> 00:42:54.190
been better and we just divide them by Beta.

00:42:54.191 --> 00:42:56.580
Or maybe a loss, because maybe the reason

00:42:56.581 --> 00:42:57.670
this blue bar is

