and then I simulate something like this.

01:00:15.226 --> 01:00:18.025
Actually we don't know it's a nice question.

01:00:18.026 --> 01:00:21.535
Do all say uni monotone density functions

01:00:21.536 --> 01:00:23.965
have the property that this thing is monotone increasing.

01:00:23.966 --> 01:00:26.385
Someone may know the answer to that

01:00:26.386 --> 01:00:28.970
we weren't able to figure it out.

01:00:28.971 --> 01:00:30.410
&gt;&gt; So much ocf this analysis is

01:00:30.411 --> 01:00:32.025
based with expectations which means

01:00:32.026 --> 01:00:34.090
