But the convergence here is

01:01:11.771 --> 01:01:14.800
actually reasonably fast and it's also reasonably fast.

01:01:14.801 --> 01:01:16.000
The other parameter in which you

01:01:16.001 --> 01:01:17.260
might expect convergence is the number of

01:01:17.261 --> 01:01:18.920
applicants in because all

01:01:18.921 --> 01:01:20.840
of these are talks statements in that.

01:01:20.841 --> 01:01:22.560
There are the convergence is relatively

01:01:22.561 --> 01:01:24.020
quick and that the correction in terms that we're

