dealing with are things like sort of one plus log n over

01:01:26.216 --> 01:01:27.550
n. And so once and

01:01:27.551 --> 01:01:29.715
gets to be in the hundreds, we're actually seeing this.

01:01:29.716 --> 01:01:32.415
But yeah, it's double integration.

01:01:32.416 --> 01:01:33.895
The expectations also say

01:01:33.896 --> 01:01:35.780
expectations of power laws are part

01:01:35.781 --> 01:01:36.980
of the challenge here when

01:01:36.981 --> 01:01:39.465
we're looking at sort of average.

01:01:39.466 --> 01:01:41.185
What's the total revenue?

01:01:41.186 --> 01:01:42.800
Now of course, average is often what you care about.

